<title>USA: Sterne Agee wins Alabama Water Pollution Control.</title>
<headline>Sterne Agee wins Alabama Water Pollution Control.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterne Agee &amp; Leach Inc said Wednesday it won a $52 million Alabama Water Pollution Control Authority revolving fund loan bond issue, Series 1996B, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.543 percent.</p>
</text>
